OL,3,GNEWSAWoman seriously injured by        
OL,4,Ahit-and-run driver                     
OL,6,FA woman has been seriously injured by a
OL,7,Fhit-and-run driver in Heanor.          
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said a woman in her  
OL,10,F60s suffered a serious, but "not       
OL,11,Flife-threatening", injury to her leg   
OL,12,Fwhen she was struck by a small         
OL,13,Fdark-coloured hatchback at the junction
OL,14,Fof Hands Road and Brockhall Rise       
OL,15,Fshortly before 17:00 GMT on Wednesday. 
OL,17,FThe car then travelled down Hands Road 
OL,18,Fand is believed to have turned on to   
OL,19,FLower Clara Mount Road.                
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
